OL,3,CTwo men charged with murder after 44-
OL,4,Cyear-old man stabbed
OL,6,FTwo men have been charged with murder
OL,7,Ffollowing the death of a man in Stoke-
OL,8,Fon-Trent.
OL,10,FEmergency services were called to
OL,11,FRidgway Road in Shelton at 7.40pm on
OL,12,FJuly 23rd after reports of a man being
OL,13,Fstabbed.
OL,15,FThey found 44-year-old Christopher
OL,16,FBradbury, who died at the scene.
OL,18,FSubhan Nadeem, 20, and Dhannish
OL,19,FMahmood, 19, both British Asian and
OL,20,Ffrom Shelton, have been charged with
OL,21,Fmurder.
