OL,3,CTwo men charged with murder after 44-
OL,4,Cyear-old man stabbed
OL,6,FNadeem and Mahmood are due to appear
OL,7,Fat the North Staffordshire Justice
OL,8,FCentre today, 28 July.
OL,10,FStaffordshire Police, Detective Chief
OL,11,FInspector, Ian Fitzgerald said: "Our
OL,12,Finvestigation is continuing and legal
OL,13,Fproceedings are now active so I would
OL,14,Fremind people not to speculate about
OL,15,Fthe circumstances of the incident on
OL,16,Fsocial media platforms."
OL,18,FIn a tribute, Mr Bradbury's family
OL,19,Fsaid: "He was loved so much by his mum
OL,20,Fand partner, brother and sister.
